-  "mini.pov.desc": "Stand at the prep counter like in the shop, <b>all 18 dishes</b>: blanching pot · sink · board · fryer · microwave · broth burner. Drag or <b>double-tap</b> to send things where they go. Drop finished bowls on the right ticket.",
