-  "how.title": "How to play · options",
-  "how.body": "<b>Tap to go.</b> Topping shelf → take · blanching pot → drop noodles (3 baskets, they spoil if left) · noodles <b>hot → cold rinse → hot</b> · assembly counter → in order · ladle broth · carry to the table. <b>≥1★ unlocks the next day</b>; money + tips buy kitchen upgrades and decor.",
